    "gearCatalogWeaponSmgDescription": "Rattler is a black-market family, not one factory pattern. Pirate shops and Pather cells turn civilian flechette mechanisms into brutal close-range boarding carbines.",
    "gearCatalogWeaponSmgDisplayName": "Shredder Carbine",
    "gearCatalogWeaponSmgModelName": "Rattler",
    "gearCatalogWeaponSmgRole": "ASSAULT",
    "gearCatalogWeaponSquadAutomaticDescription": "The Hegemony standardized the Stalwart from a Domain support rifle. Its reinforced receiver sustains long slug bursts while League and Diktat arsenals copy it freely.",
