    "openingCompanyYardCMDWhichCerberusShallTheYardConvertCommander": "Which Cerberus shall the yard convert, Commander?",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDReturnToPort": "Return to port",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDNessaSaysSheLlKeepTheOld": "Nessa says she'll keep the old pressure seals on her wall. Apparently I have a reputation to maintain. She stayed for the pressure test herself. Didn't put that on the bill.",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDTheYardHasFinishedEighteenMorePlaces": "The yard has finished. Eighteen more places to sleep, a proper command fit, and a workshop gantry. We gave up twenty-five units of hold for them. This is permanent work.",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDOurPrepaidPreparationStoresAreInThis": "Our prepaid preparation stores are in this planet's depot. Stay docked and open Marine operations: designate the converted Cerberus, then follow my lesson. Workshop bills include depot stock here; they cannot draw it while we are away.",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDCastleCompanyOfficer": "CASTLE / COMPANY OFFICER",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDNessaVennMetUsAtTheBerth": "Nessa Venn met us at the berth. Took one look at the patch under the collar and asked if I'd done it myself. I told her I'd supervised. She remembers what that means. Here's her estimate, Captain. She's kept to her word.",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDTheYardCanMakeRoomForBunks": "The yard can make room for bunks and a workshop. I've asked them to leave the sound compartments alone. Have a look at the estimate, Captain. We need to get this right.",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDMercenaryCompanyConversion": "Mercenary Company Conversion{0}",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDPermanentInstallationPersonnelCapacityCargoCapacityExpanded": "Permanent installation: +18 personnel capacity, -25 cargo capacity, expanded barracks, company command eligibility and one workshop gantry. The existing single boat berth remains; the hullmod includes no boat or mech.",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDYardCostCreditsCastleSReservedPayment": "Yard cost: 5,000 credits / Castle''s reserved payment: {0} / Due from fleet: {1} / Fleet funds: {2} / Short by: {3}",
    "openingCompanyYardCMDIVeKeptThisPaymentAsideSince": "I've kept this payment aside since we left the Claim. We won't have to touch what's left in the ship's account. The shuttle parts and first squad's stores are paid for too.",
